## Design Tokens (LinkStack)

- Background: `--bg-deep` (#030712), `--bg-surface` (#0F172A)
- Accent: `--accent` (#3B82F6)
- Text: `--text-primary` (#F1F5F9), `--text-secondary` (#94A3B8)
- Fonts: JetBrains Mono (headings), IBM Plex Sans (body)
- Style: dark glassmorphism, bento grid, subtle particle background

## Priority Checklist

1. **Accessibility**: 4.5:1 contrast, alt text, aria-labels on icon-only controls, visible focus rings
2. **Touch**: min 44×44px targets, 8px+ spacing between interactive elements
3. **Layout**: mobile-first, no horizontal scroll, use `min-h-dvh`, full-width content should fill space intentionally
4. **Animation**: 150–300ms micro-interactions, transform/opacity only, respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
5. **Icons**: SVG only, consistent stroke width, no emoji as structural icons

## Anti-Patterns

- Centered narrow column with large empty margins on desktop
- Left-aligned icons with centered text in buttons (asymmetric padding)
- Hardcoded hex in components — use CSS variables or Tailwind tokens
- Animating width/height/top/left (use transform instead)
- Hover-only interactions without tap/keyboard fallback

## Component Patterns

- **Hero header**: horizontal split (avatar left, identity right), skill chips from headline, mesh gradient fill
- **Bento cards**: mouse-following radial spotlight via `--mouse-x` / `--mouse-y`
- **Stagger**: entrance animations with 50ms incremental delays
